## User

All prime numbers up to and including n, in increasing order.

## Type

type
```haskell
primesUpTo :: Int -> [Int]
```

## Term

```haskell
primesUpTo n = filter isPrime [2..n]
```

## ghc

```haskell
isPrime :: Int -> Bool
```

## ghc

```haskell
isPrime n = n `elem` primesUpTo n
```

